docs {
  # Update Test Plan

  Updates a test plan's fields and optionally its project associations. All fields are optional
  but at least one must be provided. Status changes must use the dedicated `transition-status`
  endpoint. Requires `test_plan:update` permission and Owner/Editor in a linked project.

  - `200 OK` — updated test plan
  - `403 Forbidden` — missing permission or not Owner/Editor
  - `404 Not Found` — not found, soft-deleted, or not a member
  - `409 Conflict` — name conflict
  - `422 Unprocessable Entity` — validation error (empty body, status field rejected)
}
